      "title": {
        "en": "Zimny, zimno"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "An adjective goes with a noun: *zimny dzień* (a cold day). To say what it is like, *jest* takes a word that ends in *-o* or *-e*: *jest zimno* (it's cold), *jest ciepło*, *jest gorąco*, *jest chłodno*, *jest ładnie*, *jest brzydko*. From *intensywny*, *intensywnie*; from *dobry*, *dobrze*."
      }
    }
  ],
